OL,3,GNEWSACouncil 'no further forward' with 
OL,4,Aroad closure                           
OL,6,FTwo months after deciding a damaged    
OL,7,Froad into a remote village should be   
OL,8,Fclosed permanently, the local authority
OL,9,Fhas not started the court proceedings  
OL,10,Frequired to move the plan forward.     
OL,12,FPart of Saunders Avenue, linking the   
OL,13,FA68 and Hamsterley near Bishop         
OL,14,FAuckland, was shut in January 2023     
OL,15,Fafter the road surface collapsed into  
OL,16,Fthe River Wear.                        
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
