OL,3,GNEWSACouncil 'no further forward' with 
OL,4,Aroad closure                           
OL,6,FResident Andy Richardson said locals   
OL,7,Fare frustrated that Durham County      
OL,8,FCouncil has not applied to magistrates 
OL,9,Fto shut the road as that would lead to 
OL,10,Fa consultation where villagers could   
OL,11,Fraise concerns.                        
OL,13,FThe BBC asked Durham County Council's  
OL,14,Fhead of highways Mark Readman why no   
OL,15,Fcourt application has been made but has
OL,16,Fyet to receive an answer.              
